INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bea43579-d978-4dcc-96a7-89908717cd84','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURBbTc2NHhRRRAB','google','Absolutely love this place! Some of the best I''ve ever had, not just from our server Tiffany who was phenomenal, but from anyone who walked by. Everyone is so friendly and happy. The food is great too.',5,'2026-11-03','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3a93e329-b4ca-4738-8265-1eb1493bebbc','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kdFgxVTJSRGhmTXpOYWVGZGZSSEZIWTBrM1pGRRAB','google','Stumbled across this restaurant after a late check in at the Kimpton.   It was recommended as a great place to grab a sandwich and beer (appreciated they recommended something other than just the hotel bar).  Very professional servers, a beer menu that is other worldly, and eclectic food menu that has something for everyone.   I would also imagine with the number of TVs it would be a great place to catch a game on the weekends.   Will visit again.',4,'2026-11-02','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f3194937-c918-46f1-b27e-3296d7283d74','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNINFB1VEdREAE','google','UPDATE 10/30/26 - Stopped by around 11:30 and they were already busy. We were seated in a reasonable time and our server, Tiffany, arrived shortly. The food was great as always except there''s unique dipping sauce paired with the Cuban. Interesting... We enjoyed the food tremendously and Tiffany took great care of us. She knew the menu, always there but not too much, engaging personality and an absolute pleasure to talk with. By the time we left, the restaurant was packed and were in overdrive. Sedona is always busy but the servers are always on top of their game! 100 Stars to Tiffany!!! Thank you<br><br>Usually always busy but always great. Indoor and outdoor seating; days with nice weather, the area near the bar opens onto the patio. In the cooler months there''s usually a heat source outside. Large beer selection and a diverse food menu. Parking is tight, lot for Shops at Millmont could be larger... Servers are very knowledgeable, friendly, and professional. Wait times vary but it''s worth it. Lunch and dinner menus - dinner menu has more main course items. We''ve dined at the Charlottesville and Chesterfield locations and have been pleased with both. This is a great place to meet after work, have lunch, or a special occasion.',5,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('83c3f866-4eae-48d7-84b3-cc5661f7f36c','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21JMU1ERnBNazVVZUdOWVExZG1RamRsU0dKVFVVRRAB','google','The Charlottesville location is amazing!! Led by a Manager/Host named Troy, that cares about each and every customer by checking on them personally. Simply a great location with an amazing staff! The food is amazing as well...the flat iron steak is always a top choice and the quality is outstanding!! Brunch is always great, their drink choices are abundant and the desserts are killer!! I want to say Thank you to all of the staff for always providing a friendly and happy experience.',5,'2026-11-01','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('071a391f-38a2-461b-bdd6-c9d0de5a5979','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tneVRUVjZjWFpVY1hoVU9IWk9UVlZmU2xaalpGRRAB','google','Food was good, service was good, out server Bri was so nice',5,'2026-10-31','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('64e20296-6ce1-4e3c-8a91-2bbe350ce42c','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKMVVEZDJRMU5FUTJWS2VWbERSazlQZFhrd1RrRRAB','google','We had a WONDERFUL lunch with dear friends!<br>There is a large variety of menu items and our server (Maria) is the BEST!',5,'2026-10-28','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2335b99d-89d2-45ba-9005-bbc25f04bfe0','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oMFJuUTNhMXBJU21KbWIwbHRUVE5YY2kxV01XYxAB','google','We tried to dine in. Today was beautiful day. They refused to sit us outside ( even though others were sat out there with open tables no wait)  heard the server say Im not taking tables outside. Corine the so called  manger allowed this behavior to happen. When I asked to talk to another manager she replied " Im the only manager you need to speak too". Will never attempt to watch at this location again. Very disappointed.  The restaurant was not busy. It was 3 pm in the afternoon.',1,'2026-10-27','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e8fe4acb-c1a8-4a78-bf31-bfebce6bd874','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0elkyTnlVMWwxUzJSMVYxRjJVWFF3TkRBNU5rRRAB','google','We used to be regulars but stopped going when it became clear that there is a culture of sexual harassment and condescension from many of the male employees to the female employees. If even a customer can pick up on the sexual harassment and just weird vibes between staff, then you know behind closed doors it is likely really out of hand.',1,'2026-10-25','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cda8d055-aef3-4048-ac34-98d0e859b652','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5TWRsVlhMVGs1YjNvdFJGbERiVkJyV1ZVNFRuYxAB','google','Busted when in town for a vacation . Handled a group of 20 easily.',5,'2026-10-23','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e801f99f-732d-40a2-94d0-4864ae848773','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twNlZUaE1WalJuZVdoUVFubHdOa2xUU0d3MWJHYxAB','google','Vincent our waiter was so kind and very professional. We loved to speak with him. Great food, filet mignon was delicious and salmon (we asked plain for a illness) was soft. We loved the picture of Antelope Canyon and Mesa Arch (reminded us of our beloved west 🇺🇸). We highly recommend to eat here.',5,'2026-10-15','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('958fe28e-0a9f-4348-a722-685c8d810d5a','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxTFEybHhZeTFwU1V0eFVXeDVhbmMxUW1NelJrRRAB','google','Was a excellent.  On our Honeymoon and they made us feel special.',5,'2026-10-14','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a26f0117-fb74-4400-b8b5-89b7d51f1310','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213MmFHWjFNekk0UkZCcVZYTnVja2hsVUVacVgyYxAB','google','Great meal here with server Matt Handy before seeing Weird Al. Thanks!!',5,'2026-10-12','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3595061c-bad7-49db-9cb2-3e7901ef13dd','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WVGRIZERXblp0TUZKMmFtazNTRkZYU1dSUFVIYxAB','google','Outstanding dining experience from start to finish. Great food, great service, and Matt, our server choreographed it all with charm, conviviality, and perfectly poised professionalism.',5,'2026-10-12','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('570b702b-8438-4948-866d-77cde4d917d7','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kRk5sUXpjRXd5TjJSQ1QxZFNhSG94UkhabVowRRAB','google','From the moment Mackenzie led us to our table, to Evan taking care of our drinks and meal, Hollan checking us out, and Troy spending time with us , we loved Sedona! It’s not often you go out to eat and join staff happily singing along with the background music! It was such a fun joyous dining experience Wednesday night!',5,'2026-10-09','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ccef5ca4-747c-4cb5-bf68-5b919810762a','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxTFQwcHBWSEZOYWtObGIwMVJiVGw0UW01aWJVRRAB','google','Good food. Great service. Huge beer selection. Good for a casual lunch. Indoors is very NOISY. I always sit outside.',4,'2026-10-08','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6be9991e-861b-42b0-b691-d9343daf3288','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KSVlWQk5ja2Q1UVVsWlNFNDJkVVo1UTBSQ01FRRAB','google','We really enjoyed the food and especially our server, Tiffany. Folks are always friendly and the food is yummy.',5,'2026-10-07','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('526962c2-f7e7-40da-9978-27b88ca4ac8d','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVM05sZFNNbUpEZG5GYWFETmZkVlk0VVVkNU0zYxAB','google','Five stars past fantastic! Our server Kevin met every challenge on top of being courteous, efficient, outgoing and, there when needed. Consider asking for Kevin as your server. Food was A+. We wanted a satisfying meal after driving 420 miles, and not having eaten all day. Boom. We got it - I the shrimp alfredo, she, the prime rib sandwich, and a shared Cesare Salad. All perfect. Lively place, rustic-industrial atmosphere. A gazillion crafted beer and ale choices. Bon apetite!',5,'2026-10-06','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('da0465b4-44af-4581-9788-a03cb227aa86','1dfeda34-1e99-4a0b-866c-0213b052024b','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xvNVN6UmpRV1ZFTFhWalJucDNia2MzYmtoS2QxRRAB','google','Food was good and service fast.',4,'2026-10-02','2026-11-12T02:01:07.283Z');
