INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('24a6626d-700d-4ca8-937c-210c8ddebace','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURoenJLaXhBRRAB','google','Food is catered to a milder pallet, not bursting with flavor like I usually enjoy my Hispanic food, but its inexpensive and plentiful.',4,'2023-03-08','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('09f12708-1010-4a8c-b0d6-11410e4fa354','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURodXNiS0pBEAE','google','No flavor. Ordered a chicken taco and burrito combo platter. Beans were bland, salsa didn’t seem fresh and the chicken was watery and tasteless. Not worth the $10.',1,'2023-03-06','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('341b5a65-1bdb-4494-b674-60f77baab538','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNocDhPaTl3RRAB','google','Hands down THE BEST authentic Mexican restaurant in Charlottesville.<br><br>Prices are SUPERB.<br>Portions are SUPERB.<br>Service is SUPERB.<br><br>Where else are you getting 5 tacos for $6 or a platter of fajitas with rice, refried beans, and toppings meant to feed 2, but really feeds 4 for just $25?? PLUS, the chips and fresh salsa they bring you while you''re waiting!<br><br>The only con I can see is that they are in need of a fresh coat of paint to bring some life into the space.',5,'2023-02-23','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ac78430f-aa55-4f06-bb0a-69dbafef7a0c','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNoaDVyczdBRRAB','google','As they bring the menus they also give you a basket full of warm chips with salsa (spicy is very spicy but good, I mixed two sauces). The menu is full of options like vegetarian, seafood, and much more. We went in an hour before closing and felt bad but people were keep coming in after us. The dishes were delicious and the portions were also very generous. Pictures are cheese enchilada, rice, bean, fish tacos, and chips.',4,'2023-02-23','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5c1fb40a-c56a-42c1-9212-a4b6f70706a4','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNob2VXUjF3RRAB','google','Our favorite Mexican place in Charlottesville, hands down.<br><br>Great food, excellent prices, stellar and consistent staff. What more could you ask for?',5,'2023-02-14','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('908d5484-04cf-475c-8f4a-9e5b1416dcf8','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNoM3Iyc1dREAE','google','Surprisingly good food. At first glance you will think nothing of this place, but the food was pretty darn good. I recommend the chiliquilles or the Jalisco style nachos. The margaritas are medium sized but quite potent.',5,'2023-02-14','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('52fcb521-fd34-4588-823b-f6a4f506c6f5','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNoakxlbWNnEAE','google','This is one of my favorite places to dine, there is always a friendly face to greet you and take you to a seat. It is not often I have such an amazing dinning experience but El Puerto has not failed to deliver a single handed best experience I’ve had at a Mexican restaurant in Charlottesville. I will be back many times to enjoy their food and enjoy the experience of dining with our friends at El Puerto',5,'2023-02-06','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2524d952-cfe8-4195-a3ca-602fb2b9317e','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCN3F2Wmp3RRAB','google','we got our food to-go because it was getting late…we got home to eat— my burrito that was supposed to be chicken turned out to be tough steak!!! my beans and rice were doused in salt and completely inedible. i just threw it away :/ my boyfriends food wasn’t that much better— salty rice and a oil drenched chicken quesadilla. service was alright definitely a waste of 31 bucks. I want my money back',1,'2023-01-20','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('17c9d844-2f31-4655-8515-e2ee2fa86da6','6d1d6697-8aaa-4257-b26c-25f8b9173150','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCXzZQZzFBRRAB','google','My son and I ate here, the food was delicious and was a big quantity.  Our waiter was very sweet.',5,'2023-01-08','2026-11-12T02:03:12.175Z');
