INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cf1166cc-dcc5-4c65-851f-dee17847c7fb','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5dzYtYWpnRRAB','google','Best dumplings I’ve ever had',5,'2021-02-11','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('66173613-25e9-4d8d-a4b7-0fb9463d429c','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDOFo3MVNBEAE','google','Really not worth the time/ money. Rice was way over cooked and under seasoned. Bao bun was obviously made with pre made dough. Filling was gross. The chicken curry was bland and the dumplings tasted store bought. There are so many great places around here that I would recommend (like got dumplings if you want dumplings). I really don''t know why Marco and Luca have so many stars...',1,'2020-08-27','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0f9ecd6d-1f41-4f79-9708-b5f3271dfb7a','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNjejRHMU5BEAE','google','SO GOOD',5,'2020-05-01','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cf07cc17-535b-4c81-81ed-f70fea29484d','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNzcHZQWkRBEAE','google','This is my favorite of the Marco & Luca''s locations. Beautiful decor and a smiling staff. The best hot & sour soup in Charlottesville.. just needs more hot & sour!',5,'2020-01-31','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('053ee32d-162a-4ecd-b891-e813e215f9da','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNVak1MODRRRRAB','google','We always stop by Marco & Luca when we are in Charlottesville. We enjoy the dumplings and noodles. Cosy place with a limited menu.',5,'2019-07-19','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fa2ee9af-c6e1-43ad-b810-1e3d55a15c4e','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURZcDVlai1nRRAB','google','WISH there were more options. People working who I’ve interacted with are sometimes a little bit brusque. If you’re vegetarian don’t even bother just go somewhere else, last time I went there weren’t veggie options. If you like decent pork dumplings I definitely would recommend though. Some people like it better than got dumplings down the street, some would say skip on Marco & Luca for got dumplings. Neither are bad though!',3,'2019-05-25','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fcd9765f-27e0-4111-a495-84fe8e7ab956','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURZLXA2UVJREAE','google','We love their dumplings in the staff is always friendly and the prices are very cheap.',4,'2019-05-09','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c8872855-5baa-4a47-ac9f-ae8b746728ab','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNZMy1iSEhBEAE','google','**Copied and pasted from their other location.**<br>___________________________________________<br><br>It''s a local favorite, for too many reasons to list!<br><br>The dumplings are the best I''ve ever had. All the time, every time, for a decade. I''ve never even heard of one single dumpling being sub par and I''ve been eating there since before this location existed.<br><br>The location is just as good. You can sit at the window and watch the downtown mall stroll by, or you can sit at one of the cozy interior tables for a more private and less distracting experience. It''s relatively small, but they make great use of the space. I think they also added a whole second dining room to keep up! Always very clean and we''ll decorated.<br><br>Prices are unreasonably low. Years ago I was shocked to see they raised the price, after some math I realized they hadn''t even kept up with inflation. It was my #1 choice on the mall when I had no money, and it''s still my number one choice when I do.<br><br>But, the people are the best part. Polite, friendly, personable, and provide services far beyond expectations. Always with a smile. They work on holidays, and even organized a field trip to teach my whole (2nd grade?) class how to make our own pasta and do calligraphy! They really do a fantastic job and show us all what a local business should be like.<br><br>I''m glad to see they are still here doing well, and even expanding! Charlottesville''s downtown mall wouldn''t be the same without them! They really are a fantastic part of making our local community what it should be!',5,'2019-04-26','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a58fc072-323e-4c75-ae73-6a221e1d891f','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURvcE5hM0NREAE','google','Dumplings',4,'2019-03-12','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6218f6ab-0afc-40aa-84c5-82eb3665b98a','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ORVEyMVJkakJYYUZWUE4xOHRZWFJCU0dkb1VuYxAB','google','They are always so sweet and friendly every time I go in. The food is amazing and the good quality has stayed consistent even with several locations now. Very inexpensive for very good food. One of the few restaurants that doesn''t overcharge. Most restaurants do it out of greed and claim that it''s due to inflation. Marco and Luca''s show that there are still some businesses with integrity.',5,'2026-04-22','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('168e2b67-83ef-453b-baa7-8829f581d99b','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201SlptTmxlbTg0Vmtka1lXWTVOMU5HVEhoRGFFRRAB','google','The chicken curry combo with a steam bun and dumplings is delicious. Food was served quick and staff were very friendly. One of the highest quality, best deals on the DT mall!',5,'2026-04-17','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4d7ca6e0-cf01-4a27-8ed3-44ce75df0b79','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kek5YUkpVVUZpWDNWaWRXbHpRVEl4YVVsME5sRRAB','google','Great little dumplings for a snack',4,'2026-04-10','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('73c33084-ab2c-43be-920f-b5b4b0e3a424','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wV1RTMDBZbWRwVFdScGFqWmxaa3hhYUd3elMxRRAB','google','We visit from Staunton at least once a month for the vegetable steamed buns. The staff is also wonderful. Would highly recommend:)',5,'2026-04-04','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a6d652ac-f45c-4360-af5b-be5236ea6268','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNRMzkzc0h3EAE','google','Myself and my friends and family love this place and the food is excellent!<br>Frequent visitor for many years.',5,'2026-04-02','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('40e56cc9-3615-4702-a6a5-4c2c545c5a3c','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xRWRXcFFPVE0zYVhaSlYzRjNPSEp0VVc5UVQzYxAB','google','This was a pleasant treat. The dumplings were really good and just enough, noodle salad was also good definitely would recommend especially if you like dumplings.',5,'2026-03-25','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9d17a938-f645-4793-b36f-b2d302d38165','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSb2NITkphR2QyY1ZwYWNrMDNhVmRDTjNkMGRrRRAB','google','Fried dumplings (or get them steamed) and sweet and spicy noodles are both top notch, as is the wonton soup. Skip the expensive restaurants down the street and get yourself in here. The only thing we tried that was fine but not great was the buns.',5,'2026-03-22','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('34b6542a-c698-41a2-8f16-9dfe1a8462b9','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCTmRUa3pWMlJVYWpJemRXaHFiMDFoUVZWNFZGRRAB','google','INSANE',5,'2026-03-21','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
