INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('29c2a01c-25c4-4e38-8d77-4251e2617a08','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQyekpyVV93RRAB','google','went to a quick cville trip! get the chicken curry combo for only $12 with 6 fried dumplings + steamed bun. definitely loved how yummy the food is! the server is also nice :) i would definitely come back soon.',5,'2022-05-08','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('792d6182-ac72-4ac0-b2e3-99db2498c8bf','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyaGZDRFlREAE','google','My boyfriend and I were in town for a show and wanted a quick bite before going to it. We both got an order of 6 pork dumplings…and it was honestly our favorite meal out of everything we had in Charlottesville. We dined in and were served our dumplings quickly. They were delicious and super crispy, which I think added to the experience. Marco and Luca soy sauce is really yummy - it has the saltiness and flavor of soy sauce while also being thicker and having a sweet, savory taste that pairs wonderfully with the dumplings. If we had more time, we absolutely would’ve gone back for more dumplings!',5,'2022-04-25','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('54fc2c57-ecaa-4fbb-b138-11253db079af','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNXanBqSnBnRRAB','google','Good place to stop in for a quick bite. Very affordable for the quality of food. The pork dumplings are very good. Quick service. I also recommend the pork bun.',4,'2022-02-26','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e09c80f9-2590-4818-bbe8-69cc31849782','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNXbHNyaUJnEAE','google','I''ve always loved this place. Best dumplings in the entire city (and maybe that I''ve ever had) and the staff have always been friendly and helpful. I was very happy when they opened a second spot on The Corner.',5,'2022-02-26','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c4b51d70-c5a5-4bfe-bed1-3b9972008af6','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtNzhQdHVRRRAB','google','dumplin',5,'2022-02-13','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dbe348fd-d2db-45b9-bf4e-73e4d3041090','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtX1p2Ul9RRRAB','google','It''s a Tasty Treat<br><br>FOOD<br><br>Simple, but good. It''s one of those foods that has everything you want in a simple cheap dish.<br><br>It will definitely fill you up.  But, in my opinion,  it''s something that I would not eat too often.<br><br>Yet, I have to restate it was good and the price was fair.<br><br>I have to return to taste other items.<br><br>We had the mini fried dumplings and pork bread.<br><br>Not too salty unless you add the soy sauce.<br><br>CUSTOMER SERVICE<br><br>Was awesome!  Greated us with a smile and with an inviting smile!<br><br>BATHROOMS<br><br>Very Clean.<br><br>RETURN FACTOR<br>100%<br><br>RECOMMEND A FRIEND FACTOR<br>100%  for me it''s a novelty type of food.',3,'2022-02-07','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b5e30b4f-b14a-4b3b-bdc6-934152a7b7a3','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtaUx6b1JBEAE','google','Amazing food! Dumplings, baos, and cold noodles are GREAT! The pork dumplings are a must!',5,'2022-01-16','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d5e1bd2a-4f04-4c5f-8319-a138e44abe56','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURHcktIOS13RRAB','google','Dumplings were delicious. Best dumplings ever. Food was ready right away. Great prices. Great customer service. Warm seating area. Will be coming again.',5,'2021-11-20','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('97898c7f-233c-42e7-b6d9-4b12d4a48d93','ef2cbaed-4345-4637-9d65-58d6be2a8f6e','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURHd0xHaURnEAE','google','Grabbed some dumplings and pork hot buns at night. Food was ready on time and hot! The fried dumplings were pretty good and drenched in their soy sauce. Really love their sauce!! The pork buns were good too. Great food especially for the price! Definitely stop by for some dumplings!',4,'2021-11-14','2026-11-12T02:04:59.005Z');
