INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('acfdec0c-05dc-49a3-99dd-2e3a738c438a','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKQ2FFcFpMVjk2YkZKcFRuQmFTRUpTTkMxaVFVRRAB','google','Got 3 drinks that should have been around 20$, got charged 43$. I asked the total as the bartender wouldn''t show me the screen when paying, and they said 37$, which shocked me and then I go to find out they put in their own tip as well. I was overcharged by a lot and am dissatisfied by that, otherwise I loved the atmosphere and service was sweet and efficient.',1,'2026-07-12','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6def28c0-2da7-4c8a-bd6d-7d247ecbf057','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsM01XOHRSWFpGUTA1YVUzVnpia1ozY1ZkeVZrRRAB','google','Bar tender was really cool. Good special on domestics. Nice life music on a sat afternoon.',5,'2026-04-05','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ea9e6446-b5a0-410a-ab86-9697d5b02ba3','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oR1QwUnZSREptYm1ocWFFeFdhR0YzUW1wRVYyYxAB','google','One of the most incompetent bouncers ever. What a shame.',1,'2026-02-14','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c85e521f-a63f-4a42-ae1f-100809c8d85e','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sVFJVeDJiV2hrZDBsamFVOHhWR2xyT1d0ek4yYxAB','google','There were fruit flies when we dined here. It was a Friday afternoon and looks like they just opened and may have forgotten to clean the night before. Other than that, the food is great, pretty nostalgic pizza taste, and that Beer Dip Sauce (?) is a nice addition. The female staff is attentive and courteous, the male one chose to have his beer first before starting to work (he’s probably the bar tender).',4,'2025-12-17','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2724ac5f-09ad-4af8-89d5-41495ac6d692','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GQ2FXUk9NbUppUlc1QlgwOW9OWFp4VnpOWE5tYxAB','google','At 11pm on Saturday I was denied entrance by a rude man. They should update their hours of operation and have saved me the walk.',1,'2025-11-09','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b3547223-cc72-4ee7-a520-cbd8a8e9ca32','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tvMlgwOVBVR3h6UWpKbFdVWm1kMWxZVm5wMGRHYxAB','google','Pizza was okay<br>Service was below my expectations<br>Atmosphere is not my vibes',3,'2025-11-09','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('66565c51-c2df-4653-821a-147ff075c239','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21NM2JHUmtiMlpHVjJOWmFubHNiSGRuWlZCcE1sRRAB','google','The bartender kris was incredible!! Love her so much',5,'2025-10-24','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('797e619f-2e01-4879-b40b-feb1df37709d','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxWFNqVjNkbU42UzIxU1ZuWkZNWFJMWmxSSVFWRRAB','google','The quality of crozet has gone way downhill in the last year. We have come every single week in the last two years, so I’ve been here to see the whole journey. They now charge automatic tips for zero service, bring out burnt or underdone pizza, and seem to be inconvenienced by our presence. Requiring us to order at the bar and then upcharging us for nothing is insane.',2,'2025-09-09','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('20f49571-7ce4-4c4a-835a-baef7aa76889','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tWNWVsQmFibFZoUkVobFRXWlViekpPTWs4eVNXYxAB','google','This place has really gone downhill over the past year. The pizza quality is EXTREMELY hit or miss, and they automatically add a 20% gratuity for very little service. The only reason I even go anymore is for trivia night on Tuesdays. This place used to be amazing.',2,'2025-09-09','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2f50a190-f021-4e95-bbc0-3d9218ec21d0','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xJdFoxbHNZbGx1TkdSV2JrOVRaa2hmTWpVemMwRRAB','google','Have been coming here since I got to uva. I’ve always loved them, but their pizza quality has tanked and they just started applying mandatory 20% gratuity on bills. This is not a sit down restaurant or a place where service is provided other than them bringing your pizza and leaving. This kind of mandatory gratuity is ridiculous.',2,'2025-09-09','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6996cd9a-5a67-4d91-88c0-227a9502d3f7','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toeVFsOTVXR1UxTFRoblYyTlNjbWx4VG1FMVdWRRAB','google','On a quick weekend to visit Charlottesville and found this hidden gem off Main.  Walked in and Brendan(?) happily greeted us and then brought us a pitcher of water to start.  We ordered three different pizzas and each was amazing!  The garlic knots are really, really good too.  If you get a chance to look at their menu, the options are endless for toppings.  The crust.... So good! And we also ordered a side of jalapeno ranch that was really the right dip for our pizza. I highly recommend stopping by and saying hi to Brendan and grab a pizza!',5,'2025-08-31','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('43b3e3f2-0fe8-4e05-97c7-ed4441257bd8','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoek5FZHRkM28zUkVwSlJtOWlTM1pIT0hJelQzYxAB','google','Love this place -- Awesome pizza!! And I''m pretty picky!! Recommend going in the summer, and after 6pm. Next to no one here and able to park in a closed business lot nearby. Say outside at the picnic tables there. And a treat for the kids to have a train come by so close!! Fun ambiance. <3',5,'2025-08-11','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('20141585-71c2-4c5d-8058-80182cd070ef','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tObkxWODBlRzVDT1dsT04xaHBRVUZTTWt4WGFIYxAB','google','Cozy. Off the beaten path. Indoor & outdoor seating. Pizza tasted great. Salad was fresh. Prices very fair.',5,'2025-08-06','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('15682551-4d42-444b-89d7-c059de659b76','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VQUEd0dWE4cloyUndnRRAB','google','Rude workers, do not come here',1,'2025-05-17','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4cdc4375-1527-42d3-9018-cb65b27528b6','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2dmVUbUVnEAE','google','This is the burned bottom of my calzone.  I  flipped it upside down so you can see it.  I expected  more from this place.  I normally get a good calzone but someone dropped the ball on this one.  It should not have left the shop.  The only reason I gave the dinner 2 stars was because I had their Caesar salad which is delicious.  BTW, this burned calzone was my birthday dinner.  Oh well.',2,'2024-12-13','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('96437217-f1c5-41b3-a751-55f01cdf84ac','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURQOHZhR3JRRRAB','google','It''s not an ideal place to visit with family, but pizza is really delicious, and variety is fine. It''s also not a huge place, but good place for small/med friend groups.',4,'2024-11-30','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7003e1d6-0c77-4caa-b4fc-ca7a33a511cd','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNQdGJ5MUFnEAE','google','Delicious pizza and friendly staff!',5,'2024-11-26','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bb240a32-9b19-49b3-b4bd-29aa440fd162','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQzOTQtS1lREAE','google','Stopped off here for dinner. Excellent pizza, great atmosphere and the service was fab. Highly recommend.',5,'2024-11-20','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('06d430d7-7ab7-44f0-8499-1adc7765b53d','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMzLXUzdm9BRRAB','google','visiting the area, decided to try out based on previous reviews.<br><br>Ordered two small<br>Buddhist and Capone.<br><br>Baked to perfection, toppings excellent.<br>Crispy bottom<br>Server had problems with the order done and was a delay, very apologetic, offered free drinks.<br>No problem, the wait was worth it.<br>will return.',5,'2024-11-05','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1bca64d4-0900-4910-a336-de31e6aeee1a','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURYMG9TVXhnRRAB','google','Pizza crust was amazing.  Mixed drinks not great...probably best to stick to beer or soft drinks.',4,'2024-10-25','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cdac68f5-704b-42bc-96a6-f4b6776eb18d','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURuaUxqZ2RREAE','google','Got two pizzas to go and had some drinks at the bar. The college atmosphere was definitely in full effect. Drinks we''re good and cheap and the pizzas were absolutely amazing. The pizza was cooked perfectly, "great undercarriage", the sauce, toppings, and cheese were all generous. Great stuff.',5,'2024-10-02','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e949d3fd-64b5-4adf-b337-40f9d38b7d76','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyb01QX0pBEAE','google','Cute little dive with decent pizza. Great area near the campus.',4,'2024-07-16','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('484b0cad-0844-4cb7-9f12-41ea4b0d2cad','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURybUpteVRBEAE','google','My question is why would you give reusable glasses when you’re told to throw them out. I think that’s something fun to keep to remember your experience. Aside from that, service was great.',5,'2024-07-14','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6be22175-3293-4840-b16b-9003a74f6317','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqMXJfWFdBEAE','google','So glad we found this place...delicious pizza, outstanding service, and nice outdoor seating!',5,'2024-05-02','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6b60a9a8-bcb8-423f-94b0-9d34c2b1dc35','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNEdU1lLW93RRAB','google','I was beyond excited to introduce a friend to what I thought was a local gem, but what we experienced was nothing short of a nightmare. The food was so shockingly bad that we couldn''t bring ourselves to take more than a bite. The pizza was soggy, flavorless, and resembled something you''d find in a school cafeteria dumpster. To make matters worse, the staff appeared to be high, and the whole place smelled like pot.<br><br>Adding insult to injury, the host, who was supposed to be managing the front of the house, was lounging at a booth with friends, openly drinking. It was incredibly unprofessional and gave the impression that customer service is not a priority at this establishment.<br><br>I am appalled by the lack of respect for customers and the total disregard for food quality. I will be disputing the charge for this meal on my credit card, as it was inedible and a complete waste of money. Save yourself the disappointment and avoid this place at all costs.',1,'2024-03-24','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8d64a1b6-f652-499f-b0cd-27bce1a62df0','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ5ekl2R1ZBEAE','google','One of my favorite college bars',5,'2024-03-14','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('89a0ec27-c5e4-4d2b-b7b2-56c2918b6473','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOOVpqLXJ3RRAB','google','The pizza was good, and was ready for take out quickly. The wings were good too, but they gave us barbecue instead of buffalo sauce. I''d definitely get food from there again',4,'2024-01-16','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1c9cbb08-2cc1-4c1f-a334-8b3432929b7b','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGNnNmNXBBRRAB','google','Be aware of the automatic 20% gratuity charge (We were a party of 2). There is no mention of an automatic gratuity on the online menu, that they direct you to use, either. Make sure you ask for a physical copy of the receipt to ensure you’re being charged correctly. We were charge full price for happy hour drinks. The server, who came to our table without a pen or paper, also rang my order wrong. I received a pizza instead of a calzone, but I happily accepted because I didn’t mind the pizza.<br><br>2 stars because the food and drinks were good.',2,'2023-11-05','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('272e8f2a-37b2-43fc-9f6d-ba6b983c2ec0','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ1cE9uV29nRRAB','google','Pizza when i was out, so good <3',5,'2023-10-20','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b8c1659f-b3a1-4926-bb12-500233b0e078','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURacmN2V3J3RRAB','google','Pizza was mediocre, overpriced for what you order. Personally would not order again.',3,'2023-10-06','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('98cf6cd8-8312-4c3e-93bf-c4ab233274d6','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNaenJyVVFnEAE','google','Such a wonderful gem on the Corner! The signature zen drink was delicious, bartender McKayla was very capable and friendly, what a great smile! Live band also fantastic.',5,'2023-09-10','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('581e74f6-9a94-49e1-8d22-8f048d33919a','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNaLVBTZVNREAE','google','College bar. Nice patio area. The veg calzone was not good. Swimming in grease. The filling left much to be desired. Good service! Very friendly and attentive.',3,'2023-09-04','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('72121259-4b70-4484-95d0-b26882505968','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNwMC1TNmhBRRAB','google','Not the same as the original Crozet Pizza.  Different owners as I was told.',3,'2023-08-09','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('69f6dc69-9f02-4f22-bc2d-0a068cc91739','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNwX1pxTkpREAE','google','Food is delish, service was just awful.  Had to ask twice for a beer which then sat on the bar while the bartender just relaxed (instead of delivering it) until the server finally picked it up.  Beer ended up arriving just before dinner, it took that long.  Server suggested garlic knots since they had an extra one just come out of the oven yet it took 10min for it to be delivered and then we had to ask for silverware.',2,'2023-08-09','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a31eaf50-1f61-4e77-b087-37833ed3e3f8','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKdi12d1RREAE','google','Pizza was OK.  Not the Crozet Pizza I knew which is in Crozet.  My taste said there is a difference.  Probably a good college town pizza.  Just expecting more.  Good luck.',3,'2023-07-26','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c6213551-ecbe-45a6-94e5-2bb4accb6ca7','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4OWFiQkd3EAE','google','One of the special spots in town. Big open patio! Great food and staff is amazing',5,'2023-07-12','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
