INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('23c18bec-dcac-4e4b-9e22-62bda9e5744f','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR5MllHak13EAE','google','Great food and cool ambiance.',5,'2021-03-13','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bdcb50a4-7343-48d3-a3ce-36e75f984d8b','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5M3BQeVlREAE','google','Truly disappointing food. Gummy, pale, and limp pizza that tastes like garlic and nothing else. Undercooked, soggy garlic knots. Grainy cheese dip. Nothing redeeming.<br><br>Would not recommend and do not plan to return.',1,'2021-01-31','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8353344e-ecc5-4a51-a062-48ef59545735','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5OHZUeGpRRRAB','google','Best Pizza in the world',5,'2021-01-25','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a263d5a2-c38f-48ad-bdbf-32deaf15fa59','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNTcGZ1WGVBEAE','google','Service was great.  We sat outside in 50degree weather because of Covid restrictions but the propane heater was just fine. The waitress was great, she checked up juat enough and had our food and drinks ready quick. Not sure if it was the owner or manager who was there to help but he was very nice and got the propane heater up and working for us when we were seated. The patio is very nice and well lit and some people bear us had a small dog who was well behaved that the waitress brought out a water bowl for. I am eager to go back.<br>The pizza was delicious.  I''m not even a real big fan of thin crust but somehow they loaded up this this crust so it was reminiscent of Chicago style pizza in flavor depth and profile.  And it was still very filling.<br>I highly recommend. Even if you have to get take out because everything is closed down this place is well worth the trip out in the cold to grab your food.  And you can easily order online.<br>Highly recommend.',5,'2020-12-16','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('47a29363-5f53-465d-ac83-34fb8f39bbca','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURpd2NyX2ZBEAE','google','Not the best place',2,'2020-12-04','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f0a88792-ec1b-489f-9b2d-0784d2947205','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURpbkxXZ1p3EAE','google','Awesome Pizza!',4,'2020-11-28','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9a959516-7d19-46f7-8e68-c6bef0edc856','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpczVhTjl3RRAB','google','They wanted $60 for one large pizza and one medium pizza and 2 apps. When I asked the guy what the prices were for each item he said he didn''t have time to explain.  No thanks if you are going to be rude.',1,'2020-11-15','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('12f7dccf-492f-4a90-9d56-548fc7cdd5d2','1adbf072-d1f2-473a-b4f5-3b2b76d96cd3','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpZ3ZURGlRRRAB','google','This a sweet spot downtown charlottesville. We stopped here for chow after hiking crab tree falls. There was only one server whose name.i can''t recall on a really nice Saturday afternoon that took the time and effort to check on us very often, made sure our needs were met despites the fact that she was the only one and they had a decent crowd. The establishment was clean and the pizzas were delightfully delicious. My girlfriend is a picky vegetarian while I eat all meat everything but she was very pleasently surprised with the quality of the veggy pizza she got. We marked it as a spot where we will be returning.',5,'2020-10-25','2026-11-12T02:12:50.528Z');
