INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e146bd6a-8754-43f6-87b6-4c6983954a17','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvcXVXVUx3EAE','google','Entertaining and vibrant environment',5,'2025-04-23','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e1c8e909-b4a0-40d4-85a2-888536e94768','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJcTlPdVV3EAE','google','It was our first time having lunch at Boylan Heights with the family, and we really enjoyed it. We loved the open-air atmosphere — it was so nice to enjoy a meal while feeling the breeze and watching a basketball game on TV.<br><br>The kids were especially excited to see a train go by — that was a fun and unexpected highlight for them!<br><br>One small thing: The vegetarian burger I had that day was a bit dry and harder than what I’ve had elsewhere. I’m not sure if that’s how it’s usually served, but it didn’t affect our overall great experience.<br><br>We’ll definitely be back again!',4,'2025-04-13','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7fcdb899-ef83-48d9-be23-0aac4456eeb5','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJcTRtZC13RRAB','google','Drinks are expensive, service leaves alot to be desired. Very short and to the point service no small talk so if thats your thing maybe better for you. Not for me but not inherently a bad place. Different strokes for different folks.',2,'2025-04-13','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3d2a1845-f82e-4a2a-82de-e61416ad0528','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3M2JiSk1REAE','google','Boylan is a go to for a recruitment event I plan for the past three years. Two weeks in March I bring 60+ students and candidates to Boylan for a lunch. Boylan delivers every time! Great food, quickly brought out. The staff is amazing, especially Hannah in Sales and Kirstin as Captain. Boylan has been able to work with the different food limitations of our guests and the quality is excellent each time for all who attend. I highly recommend!',5,'2025-03-27','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('abeb8349-86d2-44c8-9a71-5ad2c27f1e5c','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRZ2ZXcWhRRRAB','google','I got extremely bad food poisoning from a burger here, do not recommend',1,'2025-03-04','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8e14f037-389b-447e-85cd-43c38c3e5da3','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmNDVDRWV3EAE','google','The food here is excellent! The serving sizes are generous, the price is decent, and the flavor is great! I was in the hospital with my husband for weeks and made many trips to grab burgers, salads, and their fantastic mozzarella sticks. The staff was always helpful and courteous. Definitely give them a try, you won''t regret it!',5,'2025-01-09','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b2086f8f-eba5-4084-b4c7-69a1ab96d5e0','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmbEtEbzJBRRAB','google','Completely empty at 9:30, the whole staff is sitting at the bar, ID is when we come in. We sat down and waited for over 10-15 minutes and no one came over to use meanwhile they’re all drinking at the bar giving us dirty looks. Would not return',1,'2025-01-04','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('aaab9e0d-b6f7-4a10-8167-410d9c75ca3e','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNYLTlXMWVREAE','google','I was told by the bar staff to not order their food due to low quality. I attempted to bring food from another establishment inside and was asked to leave.',1,'2024-10-21','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('53319f27-8b67-43e8-bf38-dea538923085','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNiOHZPNklREAE','google','Burger was good! Shake was melted and runny. Overall we enjoyed it.',4,'2024-07-25','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4e4b42f5-537f-4c2a-92de-11d9b5b5b4cf','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNyMl8temVnEAE','google','Horrible place, staff doesn’t care at all. Horrible service I had to go to the bar to pay my food bill because the servers are too busy looking at their phones in the back. Food is pretty gross, won’t be coming back.',1,'2024-07-11','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('50a3478c-4583-4cd3-a558-4e475b178740','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMaGR2c3lnRRAB','google','Staff was terrific, attentive, and thoughtful.  Five of us had various salads and burgers and all of it was great.  Excellent selection of beer.  We didn''t get the truffle fries this time, but that''s a definite "should-get" item',5,'2024-06-21','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e6d78553-d1f2-4f06-90a3-87ce9ff7bec0','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR6a2RqNXpnRRAB','google','Forgot to mention medium rare on the Burger.  The house dry rub wings were great.',4,'2024-06-10','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('15eca34e-75c6-42d9-ac56-a7ddf257239c','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqejRtM2VREAE','google','Chicken was moist and flavorful with a light and crispy breading. I had the BOMB or burger of the month, called Kickin’ Chicken, which is fried chicken on a brioche roll topped with Cole slaw and aioli with hot sauce on the side. My wife had the loaded nachos, which were very good. They made a grill cheese sandwich on good bread for my son. It was terrific—he ate both halves. A bit noisy so we ate outside.',4,'2024-05-27','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8c7e9b34-b9cb-4978-87b3-3e9d233b1f4a','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqOUplTGZnEAE','google','Came down to watch a late basketball game.  Expect the game to end at 12:30am.  Kicked out halfway through the 4th quarter because they want to close up.  Update your hours if you won''t be open until 2am as advertised.  I''ll find somewhere else to spend too much on mediocre food and drinks.<br><br>Never again.',1,'2024-04-30','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c1e9969e-929c-4e37-9927-8aca00f60802','304e70e5-b297-4251-8c96-46e58e96d6d4','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM5N0xDcnVBRRAB','google','College bar cold drinks fun place great staff a staple for gameday weekend',5,'2024-03-03','2026-11-12T02:12:50.919Z');
