INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c41ad053-9b63-417e-bad4-8e4fc73aac0e','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w4emNrRkNOMDlyZWtOTVRGRnNXblpQZFc1M1NFRRAB','google','Easily the best falafel I’ve ever had. I got the bowl with all the trimmings, fantastic.',5,'2025-12-17','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('76e4c3c8-369c-488b-a1a7-1eb494669f88','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GM2MzcFRSMXBuY1hWYU5WRjVMVTAyUlhCUmMxRRAB','google','The staff are far too hospitable and kind I may never leave! The food has knocked both my socks off and I am made more joyous and powerful by this love filled meal. Thank You Ottos staff!',5,'2025-12-16','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bca083ad-8b4c-4950-a45d-41101f15ba94','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wbE5HVmtRVzVwY25WTFp6RnVORzl4VFZwVE4wRRAB','google','Food is great, fries and sandwiches never disappoint. Sandwiches can drip, so get extra napkins or bags. Quick service, both at brick-and-mortar and food truck. Not quite authentic Turkish, more adapted for American palate. Inside is nicely decorated with Istanbul imagery. Owner makes sure to chat if you know him. A mainstay of Cville''s Turkish community.',5,'2025-12-16','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('646d909a-b1a4-42f6-99e4-770bb7299f20','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pZeU1UQnJaR05PY20xeWFXUndaMUF6TWpoWFVVRRAB','google','The sign said something like delicious, healthy, and affordable and they lived up to all three. What a gem, they were also very nice.',5,'2025-12-13','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0621bbcc-f102-4d1c-bb63-0cb51bef68db','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OeGJYUnFiRzlRZWxwaFoxcDFNWEZRT1Zad1dFRRAB','google','Otto catered my wedding and I was over the moon with their service and quality! Ali was consistent and fast to reply with whatever questions I had and he was so helpful. The food tasted incredible and it was the best food at a wedding I have ever had hands down. I waited to the last minute to decide on a caterer because it was stressing me out, but when I chose Otto there was no stress after that! They took care of everything and made the process very smooth. Also, crazy affordable for the quality of food. Thank you for adding a huge amount of peace and joy to my big day!!',5,'2025-11-30','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ccf53dd6-9fe9-4bdb-b3c3-3543c00b64ec','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKeFUxTlhWVGwzVjB4MFNXTjRZbmwyVTB4V1VuYxAB','google','The Alaturca wrap and baklava is to die for, staff are very welcoming even when dealing with heavy downtown traffic. Would highly recommend for anyone looking for a flavorful meal.',5,'2025-11-24','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1e478347-86e2-4e83-af12-0e265056e0d2','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OWGEzbFFTa3h0ZGxjd2MwRkhkV1I0Y0c5VE1IYxAB','google','Otto catered both our welcome dinner and wedding reception, and we couldn''t be more pleased with how the food turned out. Ali and his team were easy to work with leading up to our wedding (including addressing dietary restrictions) and ensured everything ran smoothly the day of the event. The food was phenomenal and received so many compliments throughout the weekend. Thank you, Otto, for feeding us all weekend!',5,'2025-11-22','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2314310f-2c46-4d26-855c-16c99270c764','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xVU9XcHlTbmh1UVdOcWVFWlNiR0ZaTUZWbllVRRAB','google','I hope someone who works here sees this. Stop marking order ready for grubhub if youre just starting the order. I drove 6 mins away and when i got to restaurant i get a notification that food is ready. Walk in and hes just now starting it. We dont come in typically unless we get those notifications. It will prevent a lot of frustration and headache for everyone involved. Esp since you never ever seem to start it unless someone is sitting outside of the business or right in your face. Thanks for your help',4,'2025-11-20','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('161eca0b-6d99-4856-8289-43ce724e0275','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GWldXSndWRWRyUWtkSk0yOXBkelYzTm5KRmEzYxAB','google','Amazing Turkish-style food! We had the shawarma wrap and the shawarma chicken bowl—both were super flavorful and the chicken was juicy and perfectly seasoned. The owners were also incredibly friendly and welcoming. This spot is right in the heart of Charlottesville, VA, and is definitely a must-try!',5,'2025-11-15','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('e397160e-7994-47cd-9d83-a46a686ffb0e','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsbGQySnhRVTVOVWpSWlRtbzRYMWMyWVRjeVpFRRAB','google','Highly recommend Otto - delicious, and super helpful team!  They were able to help me coordinate with Uber Eats in an order I had an issue with.',5,'2025-10-31','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fb9dea38-1a99-4721-a189-b99fb4de56b6','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CcGIwVnVYMFJ3WVRCRWNscFRjakJKYzA1NVFXYxAB','google','We brought Otto''s to Richmond to cater a Board of Director''s dinner for approx 40 guests. From start to finish they were wonderful to work with. All of my communications with them were through email and Ali was very quick and thorough in his responses. I asked him to make recommendations and the menu he planned out for our buffet style dinner was perfect. Our guests were from all over the world but to say that every guest loved the food would be an understatement. It was a huge success! The three Otto''s staff members that set up/served were also wonderful. Punctual, professional, kind, expressed a strong desire to please get everything perfect, and VERY hard working. They never paused for a moment. I would use Otto''s for catering again in a heartbeat! ...and most likely will soon!',5,'2025-10-29','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0f539cbb-cbd5-47fc-8c8e-a5d645dfd7d3','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25oWFZGZEtOM1JoVVhwVFJXSm5TRmRzVFZGSGNXYxAB','google','Absolutely delicious! The food is fresh, flavorful, and clearly made with care. Great portions, friendly service, and everything tasted amazing — highly recommend.',4,'2025-10-28','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('988a60f3-c11f-4fc3-8a96-a1a8f52a27a6','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ONFVuTkNWa05QWW1SUlkyTlFWbmhtUVdSbFprRRAB','google','Head over heals in love with this place. Eating here made me daydream about moving to Charlottesville. This place is in the sweet spot of way better than your average kebab joint without white-tablecloth price tags or stuffiness. Hope I make it back to Cville so I can eat here again.',5,'2025-10-27','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('40d54301-c204-4df2-9af7-4e22476563e7','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1Q2VqUnVWbmh5ZEY4MVNuSjNkWEpJT1hCMFZXYxAB','google','Otto Eats catered our 75-person wedding in June 2025, and we recommend them in the strongest terms! We had a difficult time choosing a caterer since we were looking for something to fit both our budget and our larger vision for the role food would play at our wedding, and many of the other options we tried failed to stand out. All it took was experiencing Ali’s hospitality and incredible food during our tasting to make it clear we had found that special vendor we were hoping for. Throughout the planning process, Ali was extremely fast and detailed in communicating with us whenever we had questions or needed to make adjustments. On the big day itself, the Otto Eats team brought their food truck and arrived early to set up. The food was fresh and delicious, from cocktail hour appetizers, to the main dinner buffet, dessert and into the late night snack. We also used their bartending service and they did an excellent job keeping the drinks flowing throughout the night. The entire team was professional, kind, and helped make sure everything ran smoothly. We really feel they went above and beyond, not just providing great food but also serving our guests like family. We are incredibly grateful to the Otto Eats team for being a part of our celebration, and we can’t wait to visit their restaurant for many anniversaries to come!',5,'2025-10-25','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9f2735b1-c369-4dba-b749-cdf68ab4f91b','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21Kd1dpMVZYM1owU0dod1ZqZEdWaTAyYzJWRFpXYxAB','google','Friendly, fast and delicious! The pocket Falaway was fresh and filling and the atmosphere was bright, fun and the garage doors were rolled up for an open air space.',5,'2025-10-24','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a27caa06-c6a4-434c-a4c5-a227b1bbc2b9','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wUFRWUnRaWFpWZFVsNFFVUlVSbTlRV2s1TE1IYxAB','google','Such a great location, very quick and fresh food <3 The owner Halmund is amazing, the view and fresh air from the open windows is on a perfect corner right in downtown. Support the little shops!',5,'2025-10-20','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('303d2f26-d8fa-4e0c-80a9-ea6dae6eb2f1','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WRlNISnBPVlJ6VERNMVdtUTNUVUZTTlU1SVQwRRAB','google','Visiting from out of town. Took a chance on this place. It did not disappoint! Had it delivered. It came quickly, hot, and fresh. Order was correct. Prices are very reasonable. Highly recommend!',5,'2025-10-19','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('eeb5f872-d7bc-4549-b392-57cd7da3a44a','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205b2RWSjNVVzF0ZVRndFkzbHFWREV3VHpWRVUzYxAB','google','I got takeout this time but Otto’s is my favorite place in Charlottesville whether you eat in out take out. Everything is always fresh & very tasty. They are more than happy to explain what things are and the portions are generous.',5,'2025-10-06','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3f67f626-c483-4541-abce-b98d32b91476','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSdGNWbGlZM1ptUlhwcFVsVkhkRUZhVERaSmNsRRAB','google','The food truck was at polo at King Family Vineyards. Food was amazing!',5,'2025-10-05','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1cf95e72-7197-4bd3-adf6-dfa6b64641e6','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205dGRuQnVXVEoyTUV0TVNITnpOM3B3T1hOdVNVRRAB','google','Otto''s recently catered our wedding of 125 people and absolutely knocked it out of the park. Ali and his team couldn''t have been more helpful and professional. They were so easy to communicate with, so thorough in their planning and worked seamlessly with the venue to provide an unforgettable experience for us. Our guests raved about their food, and we were fortunate to go home with leftovers that still taste great. A testament to Ali and the business: we ran out of Tzatziki sauce and stopped by. He remembered us instantly and hooked us up without hesitating. 100000% would choose them again, but we''re only getting married once haha. Worth every cent, and affordable in the oh-so-expensive wedding industry. Thanks, Ali!',5,'2025-10-04','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('82486196-0406-4a5b-a27b-63008b33d4ca','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OcWVtVTBOM2QyZWkxcldURkthRzlWVkdKTlYyYxAB','google','Absolutely delicious food and amazing service. The ottoboom sauce was so good. Happy we dropped in!',5,'2025-10-03','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('2f46d672-c3ac-4e74-a255-6d04bedb5d54','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPX2NMVVRBEAE','google','Oh my god, this young man Leo is so sweet. He is the best one here. Thank you and for your delicious food',5,'2025-09-27','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9cca6296-d3b2-4d25-9f2b-46b05c2936d0','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s5c05sSTFTM2RoUWpWaU1YWlZaRGg0TkZGVFQzYxAB','google','Amazing food, even BETTER service! The guys working here are so incredibly nice and the food is to die for. They have meat but this place is a vegetarians dream. When we come back to the area we will absolutely eat here again!',5,'2025-09-22','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9286b236-ecec-4b11-ad7f-2583e5b58d38','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxaFh6RlpkM1ZEYTFjelpFMWxUalp4TFRSTmVXYxAB','google','Literally the best fast eatery in Charlottesville. Opening a location in RVA as well!',5,'2025-09-18','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('59b5a38e-6d97-4dab-94ff-095fc73df22b','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20wNU1EaHhSa3hGWmsxVmVsZE1iMDk2TTJWU1dIYxAB','google','Dashed through and it looked and smelled great',4,'2025-09-15','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4c27f7fc-18e7-440e-9591-76d62ed20988','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0TVJuaExlVXhRZG5waFIzaHFlVmR2VlRsclRsRRAB','google','It was a more than wonderful experience with you, especially the young man, Leo. He had the best customer service and welcome ever.',5,'2025-09-14','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d1c98e4e-e284-443c-963f-09d03da3ba3a','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tJdGRHUTFUalZqYVRGZlRteDRNV1Z1Ym14dVYwRRAB','google','Otto Eats is a fantastic spot in Charlottesville for authentic Turkish and Mediterranean food. The menu has something for everyone — meat lovers, vegetarians, and even vegan options — and everything is fresh, flavorful, and beautifully prepared. The döner kebabs are a standout, packed with flavor and perfectly seasoned, and the falafel is crisp on the outside and soft on the inside. Portion sizes are generous, and the prices are very reasonable given the quality.<br><br>The atmosphere inside is warm and lively, with a casual, friendly vibe that makes it great for both quick lunches and relaxed dinners. The staff are welcoming and attentive, and even when the place gets busy, service stays smooth. I also love that Otto offers catering and a food truck — it really shows their dedication to sharing their food with the community.<br><br>If you’re in Charlottesville and craving Mediterranean comfort food, Otto Eats is absolutely worth a visit. Highly recommended for both locals and visitors!',5,'2025-09-13','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('620ab200-54ab-4f6b-a95a-3bdcc0c2377d','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tRNGNFNVVRbEZUTW1oaGVWUnZaSGxhY0VkdldHYxAB','google','Excellent food and Excellent service.',5,'2025-09-11','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('072cb411-a6fb-4618-905d-dbf3d8e3a940','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205WFMxY3daMUZ0YnpCblF6SmFkbGx6YzJKSk5XYxAB','google','Perfect - every time!!',5,'2025-09-02','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('95b65712-7c40-44f2-8a65-33db65f7b5f9','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25ScllWcGxOWEpqT0VsV1QwcFRTbkJxVFZSNFlXYxAB','google','A little pricey but absolutely delicious! I haven’t had decent falafel for a long time and they didn’t disappoint. The chicken was way way better than the beef. The Otto Bun was amazing!! Recommend that over the bowl',5,'2025-08-26','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('fbd2f216-0204-4c7f-90f5-72dc5b9aceb2','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sWVVuWldaWFJ4VkZkQlVtcGlXR2RtY1U1bmJFRRAB','google','Quick, easy and fresh with friendly service!',5,'2025-08-23','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5e9eafc2-4cf0-462d-87f6-51d53c4c9dd2','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSMVNGcHZVWGhzYkRkZldtdDVTMkpvU1U5TVNIYxAB','google','Simply excellent! avoid those tourist traps on the mall and eat here. rwasonable price, healthy, tasty and they have beers! WOOT, baby!',5,'2025-08-23','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('46a8a789-53d8-45c5-9f6c-0d8290cc7758','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKTk1XRk1kREpmTjJ0UFNUTjRTbkZKWm1oaVFsRRAB','google','Amazing',5,'2025-08-20','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('80f30d4b-3496-4053-ad84-2b459f40770c','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KYWJHeHpRMnB3YmtZd1kyTXdjV2M1TVdOS01IYxAB','google','Otto is great. In a small city with a few Turkish restaurants, Otto stands out for being great if you want a quick, tasty bite. Flavors feel a bit toned down, likely to appeal to locals, but everything is very well made.',5,'2025-08-16','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0b2b6eaf-651a-4330-abff-eb137eb5d421','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSTFQwOTZabnAzV1RWU2ExcElhbVpqV0RoNVdrRRAB','google','The employees were very friendly and helped me build my own bowl, providing lots of recommendations. Everything was delicious- lots of dips and salads! Thank you for a wonderful meal!',5,'2025-08-16','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a4212002-7dc5-44b2-9d7e-6064abf9b93e','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSbk1GUjVRM0JGVlhwVFRVRm1hR1ZVT1RVM1RIYxAB','google','Lovely restaurant, they have great bowls, panini, wraps, tried all and loved it',5,'2025-08-12','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ff4c337e-2cbc-4d95-902e-938a6551c8ca','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OcFNrNHdiM293ZDBwR1psZ3dSbXBYZFZSbFUwRRAB','google','Great food, great ambiance and service was good too.',5,'2025-08-10','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6e4c466e-4de1-48d0-a474-97c4c0788070','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxMlYwNUhTbU4xZEdWeGVHWjVOVkp2VERGR2NYYxAB','google','Wow! The food is amazing.  The fried dough balls have a wonderful set center. Excellent experience.',5,'2025-08-08','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('8900e34b-8990-45c8-8f79-b295ddd8353f','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21FeE1sZGFXR05PVGtOV1EzTnBVRmx5UVdWbVprRRAB','google','Absolutely delicious! Great vibe, service, and most importantly the baklava and burma kadayıf!',5,'2025-08-08','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dad28737-7c6a-410d-b441-016058da6e94','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCS1RIRjNTSGMxVFcxRFZFTkVZa1psYjNkTFVtYxAB','google','I''ve gotten otto three times for company events and he''s been a hit everytime. It''s become everyone''s favorite catering option for events we do. I don''t think you can beat the quantity and quality they provide!<br><br>There''s plenty of food everytime and no one leaves hungry. Definitely will be ordering from him again in the future.<br><br>Also definitely consider the baklava, it''s definitely worth it!',5,'2025-08-07','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('566b4a78-3a4b-4998-b9a1-0494f073899f','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WTGNUVTFkMU5hWm5CclMzQlVWVlprUWpoelRHYxAB','google','We had a large group and the owner and employees were so kind and hospitable. The food was fresh and so good! The beet salad, hummus, falafel, pita chips, stuffed grape leaves, baklava… everything tasted great. I will come again when I’m back in Charlottesville!',5,'2025-08-06','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('32fd9c5b-7d9b-4762-99ea-963f145e155b','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tscVozZGpPRjlsT0MxR01HaGZaRUl4Y25aWFIzYxAB','google','I always enjoy the freshly prepared meals at Otto Eats when I’m in Charlottesville.  The staff is always super nice. Thanks guys.',5,'2025-07-29','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('578d89a9-3b0f-4a7c-a8e9-dca75098f9ee','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sRGFXWmxjMHR6UVhCMmJXZExWVTE2YUhCTFVIYxAB','google','During our trip to Charlottesville, we asked ChatGPT where we could find a healthy, satisfying, and delicious meal. Based on its suggestion, we came to Otto Eats — and we’re so glad we did!<br><br>Three of us dined here and tried the Combo Anatolia,istanbowl, and Alaturca wrap plates. Every dish was incredibly flavorful and far beyond our expectations.<br><br>The staff were professional, welcoming, and genuinely good at what they do. Their communication and hospitality made us feel right at home.<br><br>We’re already looking forward to our next visit to Charlottesville — and we will definitely be coming back here again. Highly recommended!',5,'2025-07-16','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('21f73eff-bc1c-4636-8392-8c641200104e','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKWWJFRkJlaTF6TWtVeE5FTktURVZ1VjFoNGFWRRAB','google','I’ve tried many Turkish restaurants, this one is the best so far. It offers the best Turkish food available in the US.',5,'2025-07-15','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b952f178-2c23-4023-b197-ec2165698a5e','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pjd2MxVmZYMUJZUzJoeVl6aDVXak53Y2xOVGVtYxAB','google','Hello, I can recommend it to everyone. It''s a nice place, very healthy and clean, and the staff is very nice. I can say that it''s the only place for delicious food.',5,'2025-07-15','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c0a96ed5-6ab3-4d0c-b522-ee35ed0ba1b9','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tKTlEyUkdZV3R4Y21GNFJVeHdXbVU0ZGxaTVgxRRAB','google','This place is amazing! Coffee is real:)  The dishes are authentic , which is also important! Prices attractive! Restroom is clean! The staff were helpful and polite!! Highly recommend! The public parking is opposite. Thank you!!!<br>Wishing you blessings in your business!',5,'2025-07-11','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('02d3b2bc-ad8c-4099-a5e2-17dcbc21ac57','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGZmMzRjZhVFo2T0c1cVpXVmhjMGhVYVVWS1NIYxAB','google','Such a cute little place with amazing food! Service is consistently amazing and I’ve never had a dish that wasn’t delicious. The atmosphere is adorable and the location is perfect, just off of the downtown mall. Cannot recommend this place enough!',5,'2025-07-06','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('cf5aa393-b1b3-4648-a279-95babddca5e7','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25sSlZXaEJhMGxWZUd0QlVtOVBkblZMTUVRNWFHYxAB','google','Food 5/5, service 5/5, atmosphere 5/5. Really glad we found this place in downtown Charlottesville! Host was personable, the decoration on the walls is punny and fits the vibe. We got two bowls and both of them were fantastic. We would definitely revisit when in town!',5,'2025-07-01','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('358a8a3a-09d2-4ad2-9b2e-e62d827971cf','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKV01VeGlWRUowWkVGNE5IZGtURk5XZEVwbE1IYxAB','google','clean food and fantastic staff. thank you!',5,'2025-06-23','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7745c0ff-4d2c-4820-9f11-ffe7fd2584b6','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xCQlEwaFlYMnRJVjJocGNtRlFhMlpwY3pSS1pFRRAB','google','It''s really good falafel on a great bowl. Price is comparable to other options in the area.',5,'2025-06-13','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c300c7da-9871-40df-83a0-03eb652d43b1','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swelRqQlpTbmhUV2pGVE16VkpWVUV6UkZGWVgxRRAB','google','Was visiting for a wedding and walked by Otto earlier in the day.  Returned for a pre dinner rehearsal snack and it did not disappoint.  Had the wrap with beef which was made to order and it was outstanding.  Had a good selection of beer and soda available too.  The side dishes look terrific.',5,'2025-06-13','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3245b26b-dd4f-4ed9-a41d-1d23ea0d6788','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VMVGpxUGlEOWZ6eWJ3EAE','google','We happen to park next to Ottos, saw the menu and decided to give it a try. It was excellent! A vegan paradise!',5,'2025-06-12','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('28e933b4-99bf-43dd-af4a-d5aa1dbd11d0','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VKYlRwNjNacTlXbDhRRRAB','google','They would be great if only they could include their sauces in take away packages!',4,'2025-06-05','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7bd76058-1e98-48db-8b64-759dbd913ea6','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VPNlR5WXlNOE1TdndRRRAB','google','As an office manager I use many different places to cater certain events & staff lunches for my work and Otto''s is a favorite! We use them frequently and have always been happy with the delicious food and fantastic service. The whole process is extremely easy and their staff are fantastic to work with.<br>Great communication and yummy food make Otto''s a 10/10 for me.',4,'2025-06-02','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6bf56a97-c1ce-4379-821b-9e34224c7c4e','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChRDSUhNMG9nS0VLNnJxZlA0cXF4SxAB','google','I come here every time I visit Charlottesville and they never disappoint! Great options for the vegetarians—the falafel is tasty in a bowl or a pita. Nice beer and drinks selection too. And extremely friendly service, lovely staff, and a nice space to sit and eat.',5,'2025-05-25','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ffa65851-76db-4518-a1d0-600efe8e4c45','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VOLUk1T0h1M2VmQnF3RRAB','google','We love this place because you can choose from a yummy combination or make your own wrap or bowl. The prices are decent and the serving size is appropriately matched. The kids bowl is a little pricey but good for a picky eater. Fresh ingredients! Friendly staff!',5,'2025-05-25','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('72a98010-2e9a-4154-a469-58d4fcea7c34','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VOamtrdHlXbU1uQnZnRRAB','google','We go there regularly every month',5,'2025-05-23','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('31d6a485-a4f1-41c8-91a1-ab238b5bba04','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VKRDBfcmV2Nzg3dVNBEAE','google','Yummy!',5,'2025-05-21','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('d9451470-2621-40db-a595-5ff65feaecb8','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VKM2xzY1dyOTREOVJ3EAE','google','Best people. Love this place',5,'2025-05-20','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b84d3df2-afdc-49d1-9766-d664943dc0b2','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VKX2dyOUdEbUozQmhRRRAB','google','Food was fresh, delicious, & plentiful! The service was great & the servers were very good. Decor was a fun look at food & art. Loved the t-shirts! And the "windows" are actually garage doors that they opened up so you''re directly looking into the street. The weather was mild & perfect for this setting.',5,'2025-05-12','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a38387b4-eeaf-4c0b-a262-631723ebef52','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VLM3YwX2E5bGJDczlBRRAB','google','The very eager and friendly staff were welcoming and kind. The food was delicious and unique (maybe less so for folks who live in metropolitan areas). We were quite delighted. The Turkish coffee had me buzzing nicely for the 3+ hour drive home. We''ll be back, for sure!',5,'2025-05-12','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b365e9b3-4057-4e72-a6eb-f5561aaf48c1','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJT2otc2FhbU5fV05BEAE','google','Delicious , authentic. Quick friendly service',5,'2025-05-11','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('df558ecd-8620-4082-870c-005cacb91fe2','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VMSDAzN2EzbWRyWlhnEAE','google','FIRST TIME 5/5/25.  ATMOSPHERE WAS GREAT.  SEATING WITH THE SLIDING GARAGE WINDOWS.  FOOD WAS TASTY. BAKLAVA WAS FRESH AND SWEET OF COURSE.<br>THE STAFF WAS ACCOMMODATIVE.  THANK YOU. ☺️ 😋<br>I WILL BE BACK.',5,'2025-05-06','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f0c657be-a6a6-4876-aadf-ff107a150b85','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNZdkw3c1lBEAE','google','My go-to spot when I''m craving falafel! A variety of healthy options. Vegan and vegetarian friendly',5,'2025-05-02','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('28a5bc2b-29c0-4350-884d-d2659e8f810c','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURvaXBmUnlnRRAB','google','Perfect spot for a delicious, fresh, healthy, reasonably-priced Mediterranean meal downtown! Friendly service, and bringing a high school group here during Tom Tom has become a tradition. Delish!',5,'2025-04-23','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('4331fce6-d7d2-41b8-81d4-aec463e1da63','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNvd0pTWWZREAE','google','The fact I''ve never posted a review of this place is shameful. I eat there at least twice a week. This past week, as a bachelor with my wife out of town I ate there 6 out of 7 days. I think part of my reasoning for no review was that I don''t want you there. I like walking in and not waiting, and I know it''s so good, that if you knew, you''d be standing there in my way, and I don''t want you in my way. I started as a wrap guy, but my wife always got the istanbowl. I hate that name. I hate the notion of bowls in general. Is it a salad? It just seems like a mess of food. Until I woke up hungry and pretty much robbed her leftovers. Now I''m all bowl, all the time. Bulger with hummus, LOTS of beets, cabbage, celery dip, chicken, and tzatziki, oh, and a little eggplant. I get three meals out of it, but that''s because I eat like a bird which you wouldn''t think possible due to my rotund presence, but it''s true. I only clued my coworkers to it as a lunch option a month ago, and I work two blocks away. Stay away from this place. It''s too good for you. There''s a Wendy''s around the corner. You like Wendy''s. You LOVE Wendy''s. Otto''s rosemary fries are too complicated for you. The little containers of Baklava by the register taste like if honey were a singularity. Don''t buy those. Stay safe. Stay Wendy''s. Ignore THE FACT that every single employee of Otto''s is genuinely concerned with making sure you''re happy with your food. Ignore it. You are better off enjoying the dead-eyed stares of underpaid Wendy''s employees. I spent plenty of years in fast food, I made Krystal Burgers for crying out loud, don''t bother me at Otto''s. It''s my safe place and It''s too good for you.',5,'2025-04-14','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7e4ef0ce-9c0b-466e-aa82-b8b1d69602b2','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJMm9IR0R3EAE','google','At Otto, the vibe is so welcoming, and the food is just fantastic. I''m a big fan of making my own pita sandwich with their juicy beef doner and all the tasty ingredients and sauces they offer. Everything always tastes fresh and flavorful.',5,'2025-04-09','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('efaba394-8b7c-49f3-bb96-1fdda0b1e471','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJc3Y3V2JnEAE','google','Ottobun is my favorite item you should definitely try it.<br>And the baklava they have is amazing.',5,'2025-04-08','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('749a9daa-fbe7-4592-938c-9e564d70a34e','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJNzd6YzlBRRAB','google','Great food, great atmosphere.',5,'2025-04-05','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c7bc54a6-c3d0-49db-8cee-bae2e26066d6','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJMjQ3cnZnRRAB','google','Very comforting food. Made me feel good all day.',5,'2025-04-04','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('64cde0aa-98b6-472e-a3e4-f62c8b555d65','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJdFlUSUxBEAE','google','Fresh authentic Turkish food. Delicious made to order. The doner reminded me of the ones I used to get in Europe. This place is a must try.',4,'2025-04-03','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f666a907-1b62-404f-b5b1-027854c275fd','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJbGItZEZREAE','google','It was good but bit expensive.',3,'2025-04-03','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('855847c8-7e6c-48eb-ba90-b2f255f6c727','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJelBfSlZBEAE','google','This place is soooo good every single time. I''ve never dined in, but I''ve ordered it a few times from doordash. I''ve tried a few of the burritos, pre-made and the build your own. I''m 99% sure that every single ingredient and combination would still somehow compliment each other, no matter what you add 😅 my biggest recommendation is the hazelnut cake, it''s light and fluffy like a mousse with a crunchy layer, it''s quite literally heaven and I wish I could buy a whole cake of it 🥲🤤 the loaded fries are insane and honestly one order is enough as an entire meal. We have leftovers every time, no matter what we order. Everything is super flavorful and satisfying, and feels healthy on the gut. 1 million out of 10.',5,'2025-03-30','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('663afce1-20ed-4af1-b8aa-07d0941c71bb','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3aDlPR1B3EAE','google','Incredible fresh food, and they have options for everyone!',5,'2025-03-28','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('b9108e1b-8806-477a-99be-2595ac4cc5ac','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3OXVhV0tnEAE','google','Delicious, hip, college town fast casual. Got lunch here. Veggie bowl with falafel made for a perfect lunch.',5,'2025-03-25','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('846eb063-d128-46e1-9ce7-5147ecd8b60e','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3a3ZfaUx3EAE','google','Excellent food, we had the Chicken and Beef Doner sandwiches. Both were well seasoned. The fries could be a little bit more crispy; however, the food and experience was enjoyable. The experience is good, as it is like a Chipotle style, which you select what you would like and the various toppings. The service is pretty quick as you move down the food line. Will come back',5,'2025-03-25','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('f8f7012d-3248-4da8-8713-302ca80232b4','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUN3NV9PUFdnEAE','google','Best shawarma joint so far in Charlottesville with fast and amazing service, my last visit i got help by layth he is the best and smile always, with this teams i bet this Business going to grow up more and more I''m highly recommended this location to have the best Turkish streets food',5,'2025-03-21','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ea557ef5-0f53-47c7-9756-63800a2b15b0','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUN3dFB1cEV3EAE','google','I went to a friend’s wedding that this place catered, and it was incredible. I really enjoyed it, and talked with my wife specifically about how good the food was when I got home. The next day we were looking for a place to eat, and accidentally stumbled upon this place, not realizing it was the same place, and ordered it again.<br><br>The food was just as good the second time, and the people who work there are incredibly friendly and great. I’m so happy I got to support their restaurant twice. They really deserve it!<br><br>Keep it up!<br><br>Oh and it was so good I forgot to take a picture, so no pictures for this review. I was too busy laughing about how we accidentally went twice.',5,'2025-03-16','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ad4c7849-fc76-4c0b-9a8c-2ae553de4f54','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURRa0xfMkJnEAE','google','Food is amazing, large portions but it''s good for you food so you don''t feel guilty',5,'2025-03-08','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('77f21647-7ea6-4a88-902d-429a254ced90','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRdDZ1UDFRRRAB','google','Otto is the best fast casual restaurant in Charlottesville! The staff is incredibly kind and falafel is the best I''ve ever had.',5,'2025-03-07','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('0a533cba-4d71-43b7-88fe-708868db17f0','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRdlBLdjR3RRAB','google','Food tastes fantastic but $8.25 for a minuscule salad is a total ripoff. First time I’ve had any issues with Otto.',2,'2025-03-03','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('13d33aea-c152-4f49-83d3-6246f3a26577','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURnX2Z2SDB3RRAB','google','Was in town to assist with family members. This place was really good!  Falafel was great. Service was super friendly.',4,'2025-02-26','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('566aa9b9-2d36-42f7-ac8d-c863c3505b7b','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURndWFTRnZnRRAB','google','Fantastic spot!!!',5,'2025-02-25','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('13998d32-22d9-4897-8909-b723bbbba3d1','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNnXzRMOUF3EAE','google','Yum! Everything in the bowl I ordered was delicious and fresh. I don''t think I''ve had hummus that good since the 90s (before its mass manufacture for grocery). Their baklava was an amazing treat, and being from NYC I take baklava very seriously! :) I hope to try more of the menu soon.',5,'2025-02-21','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a487414e-3052-42ff-a2d7-5f7617621e4c','076db689-5c85-4d4d-ad85-217cc2db8172','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNnN2U3ajFnRRAB','google','One of my favorite food spots in Charlottesville, Ali and the team made an incredible food experience and welcoming spot that always has me craving a trip back for more.',5,'2025-02-20','2026-11-12T02:17:02.463Z');
