INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('dca5e535-48e3-4875-8a32-ccbb6e1a143f','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURLOXRHaS13RRAB','google','Great soup.  Good prices.  Great tunes playing in the background.',5,'2021-05-11','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a01870f0-653f-4dcb-a6ff-7aabb71cd608','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURLOHBqVDlBRRAB','google','So Rev Soup is my “go to” on DinerDash. I’m working on trying all their soups...well most of them. I adore the mozzarella pesto on sunflower wheat and get that lately with tomato bisque which ROCKS!<br><br>So healthy and yummy. I do wish nutrition info was available on website.<br><br>Thank you for awesome food!',5,'2021-05-06','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('6aad3b20-aa65-48ca-924e-3ea383afda70','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR5OHNPbDFRRRAB','google','This place was amazing!! Simple ingredients but soooo FRESH! The combinations of tastes were so good! I would have never thought to pair some of the tastes they did together but there were too many things that sounded so good! I wish we were in town longer to sample more!! They also have a combo option to try 2!<br>Anyways! I had to Adam’s apple and my husband has the Thai wrap and tuna salad. It was fresh, tasty and so satisfying. Glad we chose here of all the options downtown. When we visit again, we will be choosing this as a lunch option!!',5,'2021-03-02','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('7f10b37f-9fa9-4550-a366-63bd76c9e6f0','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5enAydWJ3EAE','google','I''m not sure if it was the staff that day or if their quality has gone down but it wasn''t that great last time I went. I highly recommend trying it a couple more times before deciding because it''s a small business and they might have just been having an off day, but I was disappointed in my order. The crab and corn chowder had a scent to it that it doesn''t normally have and was a lot thinner and expected.',4,'2021-01-30','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c4f43073-c65e-4f80-82a9-e0df2defefb1','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5eFBxQWpnRRAB','google','Rev Soup is my go-to lunch spot when in Downtown C-ville. I have never had a soup or sandwich from here that is anything less than amazing. The quality is excellent, the portions are generous, and the service is always friendly.',5,'2021-01-19','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
