INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('37ab4cbb-a926-4ad8-9804-c412bd7b1e6c','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpek1xWWNnEAE','google','Tied with Thyme & Co for the best food in Charlottesville, in my opinion.',5,'2020-10-23','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('1d60b5b9-aa88-411b-aea1-7a0afef070e0','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURDMXJtVHdRRRAB','google','Soups are wonderful and delicious. But their sandwiches are gross. The ham and cheese was disgusting and made me sick within the hour after eating. I’d recommend only eating their soups.',3,'2020-09-26','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ce6d11ad-cca7-4197-a64e-2c4ca978bb5b','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURDck1HTmdRRRAB','google','They are unsanitary. They handle the food, cash register at the same time. The place is not clean. Today I saw the guy at the cash  register  use his gloveless hands to prepare a salad. I asked for a refund immediately. I stood for several minutes observing them as they busily prepared the food with no hand washing, no masks and no gloves. I won’t ever be going back there. My stomach churned at the lack of attention to cleanliness when preparing food to serve to the public especially during this time when COVID is rampant.',1,'2020-09-17','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c9c1c3b6-6b86-4937-9fa2-729f0393e6aa','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNDcXU2ZXRBRRAB','google','Soups are delicious, as one might hope for given the name.  We especially love the peanut tofu.  The wraps are also excellent.  We really appreciate their no-contact delivery during COVID, although during recent months the hand-off from making the food to getting it delivered has been a little less smooth (we''ve had food made and then sit for an hour before it''s delivered).  In terms of quality, Rev. Soup is great, though!',4,'2020-08-19','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ded26d5d-ef5a-4151-bbc0-714849c5cee6','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNRbEs3bmxBRRAB','google','No Wi-Fi or data service so don''t come here for your working lunch.<br><br>The menu is creative in a way that even picky eaters should have no trouble ordering from.<br><br>Tasty. Very tasty.',4,'2020-07-30','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('9bf1ce78-45e7-4f7c-becc-281b2702ed20','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM4OHNLbDRnRRAB','google','Amazing soup and sandwiches I got the chicken tortilla soup out of this world good',5,'2020-06-30','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('bc417a4e-5694-43d7-8ac5-be74c891329d','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM4aUp5YnN3RRAB','google','Great lunch spot. Food is always good - especially the soups & quesadillas.',5,'2020-06-22','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c6401ee1-e57f-494c-b190-fb8cf8bc2e6d','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjMmZiZ2VnEAE','google','Great food for lunch,always consistent, always loved it. No more bread no more apple with a soup?',5,'2020-06-15','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('a6115a8c-dac8-4b33-9b11-1007a08526a4','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjb0tDY2RnEAE','google','Whether you''re a Cville resident or just passing through on a whirlwind tour of this foodie paradise, "Rev Soup" (as the locals call it) is worth a visit. A true hidden gem, this place hits all the bases: a delightfully friendly and quirky staff, cozy underground digs, the freshest ingredients sourced from local farms (Charlottesville was a pioneer in the locavore movement after all), and a few chess/game tables to serve the likes of both the bearded hipsters and the bow-tied frat boys stopping by for a momentary reprieve from the stress of street-level life. Do yourself a favor and splurge on the full experience, because a great cup of soup should never be served alone. Go for the You Pick Two special, and pair a Potato Rosemary soup with a nice Caesar salad, or (my personal fave and Cville legend) Spicy Senegalese Peanut Tofu soup with a Classic Quesadilla. Sure to please both the vegan and meat-lover in your life, this is a great spot for a rainy day, a non-fussy first date, or a group study session break. Bring $10; leave completely heart-warmed.',5,'2020-05-11','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('aea5b239-366b-4dbb-a0ce-6d0e46434f1d','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNjMTZETURnEAE','google','Jared, John and Andrew- handled our employee luncheon. The FOOD was amazing! So much flavor, sandwiches were huge! Everyone was pleased, and we even had brownies and chocolates chips cookies. During this pandemic, Revolutionary Soup made sure we were taking care of. #supportsmallbusiness #soup#sandwich#goodfood',5,'2020-04-25','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('32be9465-aac9-4065-ac9b-b50abe9b5e4d','5e8a057b-5ad8-433d-96f3-6b5cceea1484','google:ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNjazdDU09nEAE','google','Amazing soup',5,'2020-03-31','2026-11-12T02:18:40.230Z');
