INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('3bbe9168-56a9-4329-b6ac-9b3d6eed6dd4','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s4MWMzZGxaVWxwYTNwck1VODRTVkp1Y1Radk5rRRAB','google','Delicious meal here September 4. Chicken kebab with rice and side of chickpeas was very flavorful. Wife had vegetarian medley with chickpeas, potatoes, rice. Just great flavors all around. Server was very knowledgeable and helpful.',5,'2026-09-05','2026-11-12T02:18:41.615Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('c9aff001-322a-42fa-8084-3d6db99ddfc9','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poVmNsazBZekpqZERCMWJHbElXa3RQV1d4TlMwRRAB','google','We visited on a Tuesday evening and the food was terrible. The kabob was ridiculously dry and the bread appallingly stale. I have worked in restaurants and I would be deeply embarrassed to send this out. My best guess is that they are serving left overs from the day or two before. Perhaps it is fresh food on the weekends and the fact that they served this bad food to customers says something about their character.<br><br>The Atmosphere is stark. Bright white LED lights with a flicker in the dining area. It was clinical and harsh.<br><br>I will never visit again and I will discourage all I know from visiting.',1,'2026-09-03','2026-11-12T02:18:41.615Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('ca9b035b-affe-4437-834f-46a9cb6dad74','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25FeVIybDBlSEpQYjJOdlFsaEJVUzFMWWxOZmNrRRAB','google','This place was fantastic! The lamb and chicken combo on rice absolutely floored me. The service and ambience on top of it made it a wonderful experience. Would easily recommend this spot to anyone looking for good Afghan food👍',5,'2026-08-23','2026-11-12T02:18:41.615Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO reviews VALUES('5dc53052-7a5d-49f8-80d0-c2bc7837815e','eef4e05e-1a04-4212-a410-53c232168f7f','google:Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xveGFESnVhWGhGVlVKNFF6SXRjVWRrU201dFZsRRAB','google','This was good. Chicken was seasoned well and cooked well enough. It does not come with any sauces though, so that was slightly disappointing. But, food was good.',4,'2026-08-23','2026-11-12T02:18:41.615Z');
